<article class="env-remark" id="E1D809">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/E1D809">Remark <span data-tag="E1D809">4.1.1.6</span>.</a> In the situation of Lemma <a href="/tag/5B5547" data-tag="5B5547">4.1.1.5</a>, the homotopy equivalence between $M$ and $N$ is furnished by the composition of a chain of weak homotopy equivalences </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  M \leftarrow |M|_{Q^{\bullet }} \rightarrow \Hom _{\sCoNerve [\calD ]}(x,y) \leftarrow |N|_{Q^{\bullet }} \rightarrow N, \]
</div>
  <p> which is functorial in the triple $(\calC ,p: K \rightarrow \calC ,q: K' \rightarrow \calC )$. </p>
</article>